    "image_text_dL7gtd": {
      "type": "image-text",
      "name": "上下结构图文",
      "settings": {
        "header": "<p>Smart Watches for Women</p>",
        "text": "<p>FANY smartwatches offer a graceful way to understand your body, track your wellness, and stay connected—without compromising your personal style. Designed for women, they combine timeless elegance with thoughtful technology to help you monitor sleep, heart rate, blood oxygen levels, stress, mood, menstrual cycles, steps, and daily activity. With 120+ fitness modes, smart notifications, and up to 10 days of battery life, FANY keeps you connected to your health and your everyday rhythm—beautifully, effortlessly, and on your terms.</p><p>Not Sure Which FANY Luna Is Right for You?<br/><br/>Leather or silicone? Both FANY Luna smartwatches offer the same core technology, but the right band depends on your style and lifestyle. Compare comfort, weight, materials, and everyday use to find the Luna that fits you best.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://fany.us/pages/fany-luna-leather-vs-silicone\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://fany.us/pages/fany-luna-leather-vs-silicone\">Compare FANY Luna Leather vs. Silicone</a></p>",
