          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "Your Health, Your Way",
            "heading": "Why Choose a Women's Smartwatch?",
            "description": "A smartwatch can help simplify everyday routines by bringing health, fitness and useful notifications to your wrist. For women, comfort and size can be just as important as features. A smaller, lightweight smartwatch can be easier to wear throughout the day, while wellness tools can help you keep track of sleep, activity, stress and other personal trends.",
