    "rich_text_7mUy6c": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_XVEwVK": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Choose FANY Luna Smartwatches? &nbsp;",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_width": 600
          }
        },
        "text_fXYj77": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Compact Design for Everyday Wear</h3><p>FANY Luna features a 37.5mm round case and a slim profile designed for an understated appearance. Its published wrist fit range is 144–202mm, so measuring your wrist before ordering is important.</p><h3>Everyday Wellness and Activity Tracking</h3><p>FANY Luna provides features such as heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, step counting, and menstrual cycle tracking, helping users review everyday wellness and activity patterns.</p><p>These measurements are intended for general wellness reference, not medical diagnosis.</p><h3>Workout Modes for Different Activities</h3><p>Record supported activities such as walking, running, yoga, and cycling. Choose the activities you actually use rather than judging a smartwatch only by the total number of available modes.</p><h3>Smart Notifications and Everyday Convenience</h3><p>Receive supported smartphone notifications and use everyday tools such as alarms and timers. Availability depends on your phone, app permissions, and device settings.</p><h3>Interchangeable Watch Bands</h3><p>FANY Luna supports compatible 16mm quick-release bands, giving you options for everyday wear, exercise, and dressier occasions.</p><p>Explore our <a href=\"https://fany.us/collections/bands\">FANY smartwatch bands</a> for additional styles.</p>",
            "font_size": "f-18",
            "text_width": 800
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_XVEwVK",
        "text_fXYj77"
      ],
