    "collapsible_content_jmKYAg": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_f4cQeF": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1.  What is the best FANY smartwatch for women?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna Leather is worth considering if you prefer a classic watch style, while FANY Luna Silicone is better suited to casual wear and active routines. Both offer the same core smartwatch platform.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "faq_open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_V4UKmN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. What wrist sizes does the FANY Luna fit?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna measures 37.5 × 37.5 × 10.4 mm and fits wrists with a circumference of 144–202 mm, offering a comfortable fit for most women.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "faq_open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_bqwYY3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. Can I easily change the FANY Luna watch bands?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna features 16 mm quick-release bands that can be easily changed without any tools. Simply release the band and switch to your favorite silicone or leather style.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "faq_open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yAgNVc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. Is the FANY Luna comfortable for sensitive skin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna bands are made from carefully selected, skin-friendly materials that meet our high standards for safety and comfort. From genuine cowhide leather to soft silicone, each band is designed to feel smooth, breathable, and comfortable for everyday wear.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "faq_open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Ayz8B9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. Is the FANY Luna smartwatch waterproof?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna features IP68 water resistance and is suitable for everyday wear. Avoid hot water, saunas, hot tubs, and high-pressure water to help protect the watch.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "faq_open_by_default": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_e3ink9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Is a leather or silicone smartwatch better for everyday wear?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Leather provides a traditional appearance for work and casual outfits. Silicone is generally easier to clean after exercise. Choose according to your daily activities and preferences.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "faq_open_by_default": false
          }
        }
      },
